# Privacy Policy

**Last Updated:** October 12, 2026

This Privacy Policy applies to the **Quran Scroll** mobile application ("the App") and services provided by **placebonocebo.com** ("we," "our," or "us").

## 1. No Personal Data Collection
We believe your spiritual reflections and reading habits are completely private. **We do not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal information, usage data, analytics, or device identifiers.**

- **No Account Required:** You do not need to create an account or provide an email address, name, or phone number to use the App.
- **No Tracking or Analytics:** The App does not include any third-party analytics SDKs, advertising trackers, or telemetry.

## 2. Local On-Device Storage
All data you create within the App—including your **saved bookmarks**, **personal reflection notes**, and **reading appearance preferences** (themes and font sizes)—is stored locally on your device. 

We have no access to your notes, bookmarks, or exported files. If you delete the App, your locally stored data will be removed from your device unless you have exported your notes elsewhere.

## 3. Document Exports & Sharing
The App allows you to export your personal notes into various document formats (PDF, Word, Excel, Pages, Numbers) and share verses using the native iOS Share Sheet. Any files you export or share are handled entirely by your device's operating system and the destination service or folder you choose. We do not receive copies of exported files.

## 4. Third-Party Links
The App contains a reference link to the open-source Quran database source (alqurandb.com). If you choose to click an external link, you will be directed to that third-party site, which is governed by its own privacy policy.

## 5. Children’s Privacy
Because we do not collect any personal information from any users, the App is safe for users of all ages and complies with the Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA).

## 6. Changes to This Privacy Policy
If we update this Privacy Policy in the future, we will post the new policy on this page (`https://placebonocebo.com/privacy`) and update the "Last Updated" date above.

